    "name": "Benikea Premier Hotel Haeundae",
    "detail": "Location : Haeundae is a quite far to the other Busan's neighborhood. From Haeundae to Busan central takes around 50 minutes to 1 hour. But if you really want to stay in Haeundae, this hotel location is excellent, it's near to the beach, market, bus station, subway station, surrounded with many restaurants and convenience store. Room : it is spacious, modern, complete with high tech toilet, lighting and air conditioning. 10/10. Amenities : this is the first hotel I've seen that did not provide toothbrush. On our 1st day, no mineral water provided, 2nd day they provide 2 600ml bottle, 3rd day they provide only 1. The room was booked for 2 person. Staff : if you've been to Japan or Thailand, do not expect same kind of hospitality from services in South Korea in general. Most of the time, the attitude of service industries workers like restaurant, hotel, customer service, etc, is only a fine thin line from being rude. Same thing apply to this hotel",
